   "name": "Justin",
   "role": "supporting",
   "firstAppearance": "s12",
   "summary": "First mention: “Besides the servant to look after them, they had Justin, the chemist’s apprentice, a second cousin of Monsieur Homais, who had been taken into the house from charity, and who was useful at the same time as a servant.”"
  },
  {
