   "name": "Madame Homais",
   "role": "supporting",
   "group": "g-homais",
   "firstAppearance": "s12",
   "summary": "First mention: “Monsieur Homais respected him for his education; Madame Homais liked him for his good-nature, for he often took the little Homais into the garden--little brats who were always dirty, very much spoilt, and somewhat lym…”"
  },
  {
   "id": "monsieur-bovary",
   "name": "Monsieur Bovary",
   "role": "supporting",
   "group": "g-bovary",
   "firstAppearance": "s1",
   "summary": "First mention: “But to all this Monsieur Bovary, caring little for letters, said, “It was not worth while.”"
  },
  {
